 r←Test_AskString_008(stopFlag batchFlag);msg;was;n;parms;cl;myGuiParms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "OnHelp" callback with all possible ways to define it. Input: insert clipboard. See also number 1
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter your name:' '(Surname, first name)'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForString ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 cl←⎕NEW⊂'Clipboard'
 cl.Text←'Kai'
 ⎕NQ n.Input'GotFocus'
 ⎕NQ n.Input'KeyPress' 'PT'
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp'Kai'≢n.Input.Text
 →GoToTidyUp'Length: 3'≢n.StatusField1.Text

 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →FailsIf'Kai'≢n.∆result
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
